/*
 * COMMENTS
 * LED_PIN - used as status pin heart beat of the system
 * GPIO0 - Used to show if in program mode for calibration on init / for debug
 * GPIO1 - Throttle Cut off Switch
 * GPIO2 - AUX1 used to enter motor calibration
 * GPIO3 - Gear/ AI - For AI jumper must be removed
 *
 * Motors
 * M1 Pin 3
 * M2 Pin 5
 * M3 Pin 6
 * M4 Pin 11
 *
 *    (M1)      (M2)
 * 		 \      /
 * 		  \____/        ^
 * 	 	  |    |        |
 * 	 	  |____|        |  FORWARD
 *   	 /      \
 * 	    /        \
 *	  (M3)      (M4)
 *
 * */

